  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "A mortal Gu Master excavates the Immortal Gu recipe of bathing flames Immortal Gu. News draws Yao clan and Wu clan attention because the recipe is part of the fire path true inheritance left by Stunning Immortal. A thousand years earlier, Wu clan and Yao clan fought over that inheritance, both lost heavily, and neither obtained it. When the bathing flames recipe reappears, both forces must get it or at least keep the other from getting it. Wu Yong sends Wu Yi Ran, who finds no Stunning Immortal true inheritance left, only the bathing flames Immortal Gu recipe. Yao clan sends Yao Geng, and the two fight four times with two wins each before the decisive match.",
